    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything begins again with a prophecy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But this time, will humanity once again receive the protection of fate?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The legendary Crown Priestess, Ashirselis, foresaw the corruption and collapse of fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But her prophecy was ridiculed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The nobles, blinded by decadence and luxury, ignored the warnings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ashirselis turned to her friend, Queen Leora, who sent the Crimson Knights with Ashirselis\u2019s message to investigate the borderlands...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On the border, facing relentless monsters, you will join the Crimson Knights to explore dungeons, uncover, and defeat the evil foretold by the Crown Priestess!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>Gameplay</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Turn-Based RPG:</u></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Assemble a team of knights and monsters, harnessing knights' combat power and monsters' unique traits to defeat incoming foes!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Upgrade and allocate attribute points freely to learn more powerful skills!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Monsters drop various gear and resources to strengthen your team.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Roguelite:</u></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Each battle is a fresh start\u2014choose different attributes and skills to tackle the dungeon!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Randomly generated blessings provide varied development paths for your team.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Monsters in dungeons are randomly generated, enhancing the game\u2019s excitement.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Building and Resources:</u></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Use in-game resources to build your defense system and defeat invading monster armies!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Manage resources to develop various technologies, enhance resource collection, improve your team\u2019s stats, or build more defensive structures\u2014it\u2019s up to you!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the Crimson Knights to vanquish the forces of evil!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
